## Environment variables
##
## 1. Copy this file and name it .env (the .env file is not versioned, do not commit it)
## 2. Change the values to match your Fair-Checker instance
## See the "Configuration" section of the README for details.

## Kind of instance: development (default), staging or production
FAIR_CHECKER_ENV="development"

## URL of the server, without trailing slash. Required for staging and production.
## Optional in development (default http://127.0.0.1:5000): `python app.py --web`
## then listens on the host of this URL, on port 5000.
# SERVER_URL="http://127.0.0.1:5000"
## e.g. staging:    SERVER_URL="https://fair-checker.dev.france-bioinformatique.fr"
## e.g. production: SERVER_URL="https://fair-checker.france-bioinformatique.fr"

## Optional
# BIOPORTAL_APIKEY=""
# GITHUB_TOKEN=""
